  "description": "A planning skill that helps users start their day or week with intention and clarity.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `oya` (Plan and stay on track).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install oya@claude-community` from `foogunlana/oya-plugin`.\n\nOya is a planning companion for intentional weekly and daily planning. It is packaged here as a Cowork- and Claude-compatible plugin bundle with a plugin manifest and the `oya` skill assets.",
